{"sha": "aa8b14fe9a32ce940bc4ba26b8a61743d0fde0edea3101e06c0a22a1e114adce", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:fractions} 章 --- 有理分式}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:1}", "$\\dfrac{1}{X^2 - 1}$：单极点 $\\pm 1$；遮盖法：", "$\\dfrac{1/2}{X-1} - \\dfrac{1/2}{X+1}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{X}{X^2 - 3X + 2} = \\dfrac{X}{(X-1)(X-2)}$：遮盖法给出", "$\\frac{1}{1-2} = -1$ 于 $1$ 处，$\\frac{2}{2-1} = 2$ 于 $2$ 处：", "$\\dfrac{-1}{X-1} + \\dfrac{2}{X-2}$.", "", "$\\dfrac{X^2+1}{X(X-1)}$：次数差为 $0$，故有整式", "部分：作除法，$X^2 + 1 = (X^2 - X) + (X + 1)$，于是 $F = 1 +", "\\frac{X+1}{X(X-1)}$。对余式用遮盖法，$\\frac{1}{-1} = -1$", "于 $0$ 处，$\\frac{2}{1} = 2$ 于 $1$ 处：", "\\[", "F = 1 - \\frac{1}{X} + \\frac{2}{X-1} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:2}", "$\\dfrac{1}{X(X^2+1)}$：形式为 $\\frac aX + \\frac{bX + c}{X^2 + 1}$。", "在 $0$ 处用遮盖法得 $a = 1$。由 $xF$ 的极限得 $0 = a + b$，故 $b = -1$。", "代入 $X = 1$：$\\frac12 = 1 + \\frac{c - 1}{2}$，故 $c = 0$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{X(X^2+1)} = \\frac 1X - \\frac{X}{X^2+1} .", "\\]", "", "$\\dfrac{X^3}{X^2+X+1}$：作除法，$X^3 = (X^2+X+1)(X - 1) + 1$，故", "\\[", "\\frac{X^3}{X^2+X+1} = X - 1 + \\frac{1}{X^2 + X + 1} ,", "\\]", "已是实分解形式（二次式的判别式", "为负）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:3}", "$\\dfrac{1}{X^2(X-1)}$：形式为 $\\frac{a}{X^2} + \\frac bX +", "\\frac{c}{X-1}$。在二重极点 $0$ 处用遮盖法：", "$a = \\bigl[\\frac{1}{X-1}\\bigr]_{0} = -1$。在 $1$ 处用遮盖法得 $c = 1$。", "由 $xF$ 的极限得 $0 = b + c$，故 $b = -1$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{X^2(X-1)} = -\\frac{1}{X^2} - \\frac1X + \\frac{1}{X-1} .", "\\]", "", "$\\dfrac{X+1}{(X-1)^3}$：令 $Y = X - 1$，则分子为 $Y + 2$：", "\\[", "\\frac{Y + 2}{Y^3} = \\frac{1}{Y^2} + \\frac{2}{Y^3}", "= \\frac{1}{(X-1)^2} + \\frac{2}{(X-1)^3} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:4}", "极点为四次单位根 $1, \\iu, -1, -\\iu$，均为", "单极点。取 $B' = 4X^3$，由单极点公式，$a$ 处的系数为", "$\\frac{1}{4a^3} = \\frac{a}{4a^4} = \\frac a4$（利用 $a^4 = 1$）。于是", "在 $\\C$ 上：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{X^4 - 1}", "= \\frac{1/4}{X - 1} - \\frac{1/4}{X + 1}", "+ \\frac{\\iu/4}{X - \\iu} - \\frac{\\iu/4}{X + \\iu} .", "\\]", "合并共轭对（公分母为 $X^2 + 1$）：", "$\\frac{\\iu}{4}\\bigl(\\frac{1}{X-\\iu} - \\frac{1}{X+\\iu}\\bigr) =", "\\frac{\\iu}{4}\\cdot\\frac{2\\iu}{X^2+1} = \\frac{-1/2}{X^2+1}$。在", "$\\R$:", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{X^4 - 1}", "= \\frac{1/4}{X-1} - \\frac{1/4}{X+1} - \\frac{1/2}{X^2 + 1} .", "\\]", "\\emph{在 $X = 0$ 处检验：}$-1 = -\\frac14 - \\frac14 - \\frac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:5}", "$\\dfrac{X^2}{(X^2+1)^2} = \\dfrac{(X^2 + 1) - 1}{(X^2+1)^2} =", "\\dfrac{1}{X^2+1} - \\dfrac{1}{(X^2+1)^2}$.", "", "于是得一个原函数：", "\\[", "\\int \\frac{x^2\\,\\dd x}{(x^2+1)^2}", "= \\arctan x - \\frac12\\Bigl(\\arctan x + \\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\Bigr) + C", "= \\frac12\\arctan x - \\frac{x}{2(x^2+1)} + C .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:6}", "极点 $0, -1, \\dots, -n$ 均为单极点。在 $-k$ 处用遮盖法：", "\\[", "c_k = \\frac{n!}{\\prod_{j \\neq k} (-k + j)}", "= \\frac{n!}{\\bigl(\\prod_{j=0}^{k-1}(j - k)\\bigr)", "\\bigl(\\prod_{j=k+1}^{n}(j-k)\\bigr)}", "= \\frac{n!}{(-1)^k k!\\,(n-k)!} = (-1)^k \\binom nk .", "\\]", "于是", "\\[", "\\frac{n!}{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+n)}", "= \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\frac{(-1)^k \\binom nk}{X + k} .", "\\]", "（检验 $n = 1$ 的情形：$\\frac{1}{X(X+1)} = \\frac1X -", "\\frac{1}{X+1}$.)", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:fractions:7}", "$P = X^n - 1$ 有 $n$ 个单根 $\\omega^k$", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:complex:roots}），由", "\\cref{exo:b1:poly:11}中的对数导数恒等式可得", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\frac{1}{X - \\omega^k}", "= \\frac{P'(X)}{P(X)} = \\frac{n X^{n-1}}{X^n - 1} .", "\\]", "当 $X = 2$，$n = 4$ 时，右边 $= \\frac{4 \\times 8}{15} =", "\\frac{32}{15}$。左边：$\\frac{1}{2-1} + \\frac{1}{2+1} +", "\\frac{1}{2 - \\iu} + \\frac{1}{2 + \\iu} = 1 + \\frac13 + \\frac{4}{5} =", "\\frac{15 + 5 + 12}{15} = \\frac{32}{15}$，利用 $\\frac{1}{2-\\iu} +", "\\frac{1}{2+\\iu} = \\frac{4}{5}$.", "\\end{solution}", ""]}